.hw 	gl  	Note: /mu/ : [mv~·] or [§mv] : "mvuh"xx  	     The sequence of labial nasal /m/ plus the vowel /u/ is realized phonexx  	     tically as a nasal affricate [mv] plus high back unrounded nasalized xx  	     vowel [~·].  For many speakers the vowel of /mu/ is often swallowed up xx  	     entirely, yielding a syllabic nasal affricate pronounced with extreme xx  	     lip-spreading [§mv] (GL, pp. 3-4).  The missionary orthography writes xx  	     these syllables mvuh.xx  	          See notes on /pu/, /phu/, /bu/..hw 	mupos 	Mpfxgl  	1. *hair (in general); body hair; *fur (of animal); *feather|s (of bird)ngl 	2. *needle (of conifer)note	< PLB *Ö-muwÁ < *Ö-mul [& WB mwÈe < PLB Tone *2] < PTB *s/r-mul &  *s/r-mil [STC #2]; cf. khä (Mpfx) 'thread, string'; same etymon as mu (Bn) [q.v.]..hw 	|u-mu  ±  |u-khä=mupos 	Ngl  	hair of the headnote	SYNS. |o-qÑo=mu (N), c|•=khä-mu (N), y|•=khä-mu (N)..hw 	\¿-mu thÑay vepos 	OVgl  	*moult; change one's coat (of animals)..hw 	\¿-mu p\” vepos 	SVgl  	have hair fall out; lose hair; shed fur..hw 	kh•-mupos 	Ngl  	hair on the legs..hw 	c|•=khä-mupos 	Ngl  	hair of the headnote	SYN. y|•=khä-mu (N)..hw 	cha-mupos 	Ngl  	female pubic hair..hw 	thÈ¿-phu=mupos 	Ngl  	needle of the white pine..hw 	nÑ”-mupos 	Ngl  	male pubic hair..hw 	pÈa-cÈ•Ö=mupos 	Ngl  	*beard; *moustache; *whisker|s; facial hair..hw 	mÈäÖ-q|u=mupos 	Ngl  	*eyebrow..hw 	mÈäÖ-mupos 	Ngl  	*eyelash..hw 	h|a-p•=mupos 	Ngl  	*moss on a rock ("rock-hair")note	SYN. h|a-p•­\¿-mu=lu (N)..hw 	ÙgÈo-p\e=mupos 	Ngl  	hair on the belly..hw 	ÇsÑa-mupos 	Ngl  	animal fur..hw 	ÇsÈ•Ö-mupos 	Ngl  	*moss on a tree ("tree-hair")note	SYN. ÇsÈ•Ö-mu=lu (N)..hw 	y|•=khä-mupos 	Ngl  	hair of the headnote	SYNS. |u(-khä)=mu, |o-qÑo=mu, c|•=khä-mu (all N's).hw 	mupos 	Vadjgl  	be *high (of objects); *tall (of people); *important, *eminent (of people)note	< PLB *mra³£ (cf. WB mra³') < PTB *m-ra³ [STC p. 43]; there is n